      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6948d3d9833cf56dc2cb21012bd24a65b555f3448171d404cd08cd944b0507e",
      "text": "The Model",
      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d78097c4a8b321e17aec0ec2422df06b7897becabd2bda26358502875195b07",
      "text": "Model",
      "hash": "5e2c614c23f02239bc03c6c04fcb681950f9e72bf8fdff6be79c79841cbb10c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "c164d61bbe4c8c24896ff944461ea74a23930d187faf6143f1b59af7ea7be7ef",
      "text": "The parameters. Stateless — does next-token prediction and nothing else. Cannot do anything agentic on its own.",
      "hash": "aa98c9bb7a544cfc19b000f6c2d874b3036a7c280b8f0930cb91ec2f6816350a"
    },
    {
      "id": "5cf043cadfde24ec203925fad9c585f6f475d574832a41c642a2442542025473",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "3bb344149eaad2963ed338cd2695911eb2caff85acaf61f65d31770498cd19cf",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a3f29d8fb68812f9b7be0a416e8509deb55fbc5ade7169665c6c362e902ecbd",
      "text": "The",
      "hash": "b344d80e24a3679999fa964450b34bc24d1578a35509f934c1418b0a20d21a67"
    },
    {
      "id": "af413bef8071ac0c73c0cbd437297405c3e8e18355e9007ee1e4f83af61d06fa",
      "text": "Stateless",
      "hash": "f0916a93b0a1776f11d26f8ea012555868465f41131bb6037f712455ac330788"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a549f4f85e2bad3b76843158dae36653248cfea8ae3c954793af3ae30f16b3c",
      "text": "— does",
      "hash": "353b7bcca5a38edbb61c56b0da7a5f2a6ce7d62b5c4e98fb828bd913d5f81d85"
    },
    {
      "id": "4d90f1c9e5c25c54ba15a80a12a9e9ffe9a16a59f516e31937f921d01d25c795",
      "text": "next-token prediction",
      "hash": "8203f57feb66cc8742e92d9fe92000a0898a09207548cb184413f5f2607f0f54"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b30a5d0430ccf9cf8b618b23a73ac5fe123214274e3ec508e123b2df94d511e",
      "text": "and nothing else. \"Claude Opus 4.x\" and \"GPT-5.x\" are models. On its own a model can't do anything agentic; it has to be",
      "hash": "ba55191c0e76ecdba0b914ea6a496a1609784532ca7ccbf8d596a6a2c47e23cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c02253fe1e5446501ef81b3a66633e1baa930aef1dabcbc92048eb8f0d56e1c",
      "text": "Models can't read files, run commands, browse the web, or remember yesterday — it takes",
      "hash": "9b92cb06556471126a998e6f26c647cc81d496255c6d6e6af29391e7619abeaa"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c77ee3483c6841c3aedb290ccd1529ca1ddef12c2c882ec1c510ec611a0ba1c",
      "text": "in and predicts tokens out, once per",
      "hash": "c46200544445476faa9220d1a2f7e0c27fd3b99834069b0e57bd0e0f5a430701"
    },
    {
      "id": "059bc1c8262680798ec65210e2884bc7caeedbc1fe7eae6164d329b62390a9e5",
      "text": "model provider request",
      "hash": "3004d539f1f0ae7a40070d95ba4a1323d874684827edf4d55b29a1056f8da7a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "93b08c3a89df3db89588a723ff292f331cf67a26f795645da184e6032294d75a",
      "text": ". Everything that feels like an",
      "hash": "c40f98cece27131a092797c1c58830b671ca646ccda73e977497fc6ecb485a0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5599c2dd7f08395d60548af4f99baf6904cccebad2c37e79d292401c0a6a550",
      "text": "working — choosing",
      "hash": "afe1ef8322e125da085b3e184e9d1f9622699f5b4038dfe929d8bc1075445e7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "84efce3875e4608b3409e1d595c23b9ea43085c8d2881da996d91c3748a71759",
      "text": ", reading results, looping until the task is done — is the harness orchestrating many of those predictions in a row.",
      "hash": "fafae3905a42fd21b3484e9c276d28dbbaa831c330623c1fd1588466898df3f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5fec5fb1d759820887ff0bfa806fbf3cb9fa484965add33abbda51aacc3d79b",
      "text": "Model providers",
      "hash": "fbdc457db2188277572ebe37cb288af1d0737e4f61d7180a2c0de75c5ca9e428"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae003581ebbad238bcb63c01c4fbf518abe3910ce802d4ebcf4f87f10e37c21a",
      "text": "ship models in tiers: a large one that's smartest but slow and expensive, and smaller ones that are faster and cheaper but less capable. Picking a tier is a real decision — heavyweight for planning and hard debugging, lightweight for mechanical changes — and harnesses let you switch mid-",
      "hash": "4dcef60cf19b6ad55b62f8e7a00b48a94d6ba46f6e45046419a6a716dbcdf5a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "831fb874f33b215377d4f6b83d0ed5657a54bb792a5acfde916161c9eb2e522e",
      "text": "Being strict about the word also sharpens diagnosis. \"The model is bad at this\" is a specific claim — the same model in a different harness, or with a different",
      "hash": "78ab4b42b7777a82424f82beee3d7f5c544f1bbb4cab4c3880818d2827c94902"
    },
    {
      "id": "1fba15fcc210abdab841720ea9fe7f8674862e71b2ab325edf20bbfc2cc6ab05",
      "text": ", often behaves completely differently. Before blaming the model, check what it was given: most disappointing output traces back to context or harness, not parameters.",
      "hash": "38176199a90977a50d59c94f7c0d848ca2fe5171260ece8e365a0eb69dce3bdc"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9ce6268a59cca3ec114b2ad6c598d548e703ff2a6e82d8c5271dd58e4798558",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "cbc20b59e0f0207faa3b665f98fa627f736bcd80dd37e787d023a651271770d9",
      "text": "\"Should we switch the model from Sonnet to Opus for the planning step?\"",
      "hash": "9a07732be525383878d25cc8b184cd4a5380200140e12505a50f8cdbdabbc7d6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bc8bdf99deb7547bc47630f33bf7506be55e85d0f84a51c3052ee1156f3975df",
      "text": "\"Try it — but the harness is doing most of the lifting on this task. The model swap won't help if the",
      "hash": "2e42809ec4c17e2f60340c55f760079b5169b5107dbc45e0824602e8fd22a046"
    },
    {
      "id": "47d86db9792d6cdf89a01098d3433179e8445952fa0e6fea60a5bd19531e0076",
      "text": "system prompt",
      "hash": "e16202309c92180728dd7fd1c59f16004a6d5ee245538c28d2a9a22edf2dd2ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "9eee7a871d4fb95e341fffe232e4398d803bfce3ac34c1308450c76472ffd83a",
      "text": "and tools are wrong.\"",
      "hash": "44fbad73d8980b63b9c24d171c84acc41406ddd4be55b71dc049df8a273c982e"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9fbc7a8007711ff923fa344da7819b0464d5b9cc5e0a1bcb1b75b2a3da2b537",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8ed40a94b17d480bd9594718fd9dc8282696b9ad0a874e1ae6e22e25ab98fec",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "abd96530cc304496b4d4adaee43607aef228d93f2b0f66eec6794cf2c04ae018",
      "text": "Parameters",
      "hash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0a66e04c77528f589a128e7d47ba6e0441c9fc006f04454952028f34a5cbea4",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f226657376c7df593a00aaea1a2b6c0852a89b104644129f7f8379e9b2efe45",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
